              is a weak equivalence by lemma
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#InCfPullbackAlongFibrationPreservesWeakEquivalences"}
              and with this
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
